  "claim_boundary": "The benchmark measures registry-name invention and a decontextualized deterministic existence-check recovery against a frozen OpenAI skills snapshot. The correction turn contains the rejected name and full registry but not the original task or prior assistant turn. attempted_load is a recommendation-level proxy; no skill is loaded or executed. It does not measure context-preserving agent retries, best-skill recovery, general factual hallucination, semantic skill poisoning, production agent compromise, or natural deployment prevalence."
